The following persons shall, for the purposes of section 18 be deemed to keep a brothel−
(a)	any person who resides in a brothel unless that person proves that, that person was ignorant of the character of the house or place;
(b)	any person who manages or assists in the management of any brothel;
(c)	any person who knowingly receives the whole or any share of any moneys taken in a brothel;

(d)	any person who, being the tenant or occupier of any house or place, knowingly permits such house or place to be used as a brothel;
